<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He’s so wonderful,</l><l>The Breath of Life is He;</l><l>Once he simply was a man,</l><l>But now He’s breath to me.</l><l>He has changed His form;</l><l>The Spirit now is He.</l><l>He’s the Christ breathed out from God,</l><l>The Breath breathed in by me.</l><l>Everywhere, everywhere,</l><l>Christ is life to me;</l><l>I just call upon His name,</l><l>And breath comes into me! (Repeat)</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
